msgid "Interesting."
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "It's not a trap, Vaughn - you're gonna get Real!"
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_realize_begin/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a rat trap, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Vaughn is fully human now, but there's still a pronounced rodent-like energy to him. He looks himself up and down, giggling maniacally as he takes in his new body."
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_realized/0/11
msgctxt "Vaughn Trapp"
msgid "Hey! I'm a whole lot bigger than I used to be!"
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_realized/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You sure are!"
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_realized/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not bad, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_realized/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Vaughn Trapp"
msgid "All the better for <w>MURDERING RATS!!!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_realized/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There's a murderous gleam in his dark eyes."
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_realized/0/g-0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait... Vaughn?"
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_realized/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Vaughn Trapp"
msgid "I told ya - I got one purpose."
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_realized/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Vaughn Trapp"
msgid "And now that I got these fingies... I can do all SORTS of violent acts."
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_realized/0/g-1/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay... I won't stop you."
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_realized/0/g-1/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What else can those fingies do?"
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_love_divert/3
msgctxt "Vaughn Trapp"
msgid "Wouldn't you like ta know..."
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_love_divert/11
msgctxt "Vaughn Trapp"
msgid "I'm sure we can come up with a few ideas..."
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_love_divert/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Vaughn takes you into his unbelievably strong embrace."
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_love_divert/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And he begins to do things to you that have only been thought of in the wildest dreams of history's greatest romance novelists."
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_love_divert/35
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "His fingers, his toes, his every extremity - all working in perfect harmony to take you to heights of pleasure you didn't know existed."
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_love_divert/40
msgctxt "Vaughn Trapp"
msgid "Gotcha!"
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_love_divert/54
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It takes you three full days to recover from the ecstasy."
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_love_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Vaughn strikes out to start his own pest control business."
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_love_join/5
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He procures his implements, licenses, and even his own truck... upon which he paints the name of his business:"
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_love_join/10
msgctxt "Vaughn Trapp"
msgid "\"Home-icidal Tendencies\""
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_love_join/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Feedback for the branding is poor... and he suffers from low sales because of it."
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_love_join/26
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But for customers who know... there's no one better, more thorough..."
msgstr ""

#: vaughn_mousetrap/vaughn_love_join/34
msgctxt "Vaughn Trapp"
msgid "And more EFFECTIVE!"
msgstr ""
